// 128KB of `'{a}' + '}'.repeat(n) + ',z}'` blocked the event loop for 27
// seconds to produce two results. `EXPANSION_MAX_REWRITES` bounds how many
// times the scan may restart. Real `{a},b}` input needs a handful.
