   * exists, it is replaced by the specified tag.
   *
   * @example
   *
   * ```javascript
   * import { CORE_SCHEMA, mergeTag, realMapTag } from 'js-yaml'
   *
   * const schema = CORE_SCHEMA.withTags(mergeTag, realMapTag)
